+/**
+ * This frame's wheel, as a count (D-083).
+ *
+ * inputKeyPressed(VK_MOUSE_WHEEL_DN) is a yes/no, so menu.c's
+ * inputs.mousescroll could never be more than one, and a thumb that dragged
+ * nine rows' worth in a frame moved the menu one line. menu.c asks for the
+ * count instead while the pointer is live; the keys above still answer for
+ * anything else that reads them.
+ */
